{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x24ed4a",
      "back_en": "will go back to their country tomorrow.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24ef3c",
      "back_en": "...About them?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f327",
      "back_en": "but... ah, how do I say it...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f3a4",
      "back_en": "your spine...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f3e8",
      "back_en": "Still, makes me wonder who they really are.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f569",
      "back_en": "faces for this little journey.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'figureheads' = fantoches/líderes nominais; 'rostos' perde o sentido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f65d",
      "back_en": "Kid, you ever hear of the Onkamiyamukai?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f686",
      "back_en": "The twins freeze for the briefest moment",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel (gênero presumido)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f74d",
      "back_en": "Uitsualnemetia.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Nome próprio."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f790",
      "back_en": "and brought famine and suffering upon them.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f7cb",
      "back_en": "That's their god. We of Yamato, who worship",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f7fc",
      "back_en": "the god incarnate, the Mikado, that's how we",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x250083",
      "back_en": "civilian, you might never see another sunrise.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x250e8b",
      "back_en": "Can she really not see them?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2512b3",
      "back_en": "You promised you'd come back home, right?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251337",
      "back_en": "Ku... is leaving...?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source diz 'Kuon', traduzido como 'Ku' — possível troca de personagem."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x25182b",
      "back_en": "Look after Ku for us.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251d43",
      "back_en": "Aruruu.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Nome próprio."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251db5",
      "back_en": "And just as they pass, my eyes meet with theirs.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251e12",
      "back_en": "message.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24e7e3",
      "back_en": "What do you mean?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente natural."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24e93e",
      "back_en": "Oh, thanks.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24ea06",
      "back_en": "Haku & Ukon",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Nomes."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24eb9c",
      "back_en": "I'm sure it won't come cheap.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24eff4",
      "back_en": "In the end, they seem to be just what they appear.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f167",
      "back_en": "to do anything underhanded for their country.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f743",
      "back_en": "for that.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f8c6",
      "back_en": "relatively accepting with these kinds of things.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'aceitadores' soa estranho mas compreensível."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24f92a",
      "back_en": "we're not so impulsive as to do anything against",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel (frase truncada)."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24fa39",
      "back_en": "You felt something, huh? Yeah... I can't get a read",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24fbc4",
      "back_en": "apparently she also holds a pretty high position.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24fc41",
      "back_en": "Did you see that beast she was riding?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24feca",
      "back_en": "sets it on the floor and pushes it toward",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x24ffbe",
      "back_en": "explaining.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x250198",
      "back_en": "No need. I need to think a bit on my own--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x250496",
      "back_en": "a little.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x25098c",
      "back_en": "supposed to be heading back to your own country",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x250cfb",
      "back_en": "She was quite right.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x250f01",
      "back_en": "Upsie-daisy!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x250f6e",
      "back_en": "Hmhm. Smells like Ku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251070",
      "back_en": "W-Would you stop talking as if I stink of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x25128a",
      "back_en": "The period we decided on already passed.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251a90",
      "back_en": "I take a quick look at the person at my side.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251b51",
      "back_en": "Kuon looks away, her eyes on the procession.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x251cd3",
      "back_en": "How rude...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    }
  ],
  "reviewed": 45
}